      "problem": "Which of the following is the net of a triangular pyramid?",
      "worked_solution": "Let's start by portraying our triangular pyramid:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14248692/assets/0599b93689ea7066815bca05706eb44cf4fcea5eee12482ad3e2e7360a063b5c.png)\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nIf we were to unfold the pyramid above along its edges, we'd get the net shown below.\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14248692/assets/94e87252eb416f9424cb191e060a3e7294d130349c77a8fd87d2c12051378aa8.png)\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14248692/assets/c603092d3d64352abf3746123afd04c58be06c56d917c6e53123fab8ea4d1d17.png)",
